OL,3,APowerful magnitude 7.7 earthquake hits
OL,4,APanama, damaging buildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA massive magnitude 7.7 earthquake has
OL,7,Fhit Panama, damaging buildings and
OL,8,Fcausing widespread shaking.
OL,10,FAbout 4.6 million people felt moderate
OL,11,Fto severe tremors as a result of the
OL,12,Fquake, according to the US Geological
OL,13,FSurvey, which has said that the effects
OL,14,Fof the quake were "likely to be
OL,15,Fwidespread".
OL,17,FIt struck just before 15:00 local time
OL,18,F(18:00 GMT) on Friday, with an
OL,19,Fepicentre about 6.2 miles (10km) from
OL,20,Fthe town of Pitaloza Arriba in
OL,21,Fsouth-central Panama.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
