OL,3,APowerful magnitude 7.7 earthquake hits
OL,4,APanama, damaging buildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootage shared online appears to show
OL,7,Fcollapsed buildings in the towns of
OL,8,FPenonome and Sona, including one of a
OL,9,Fman calling out to anyone trapped under
OL,10,Fthe rubble of a collapsed building. No
OL,11,Fcasualties have so far been reported.
